<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλῐεύς</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inhabitant of Malis</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλίς</span>), 
				Ion.
			 pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλιέες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.132
				</span></i>
			, etc.; early 
				Att.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλιῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.92
				</span></i>
			, etc.; later the 
				Dor.
			 form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μᾱλ</span>- was used,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1297b14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.57
			</span></i>: as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλιεὺς κόλπος</span>
			<i>the Sinus Maliacus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.33
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλῐακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.96
			</span></i>, etc.; fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλὶς</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλιεὺς κόλπος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				636
			</span></i> (lyr.); M. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ, χώρη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.198
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				8.31
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μηλιάδες</span>.</div>
